Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: Sampling procedure: Literature data
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: 
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3ad53529-7aea-3aa6-8590-33ebfbcdfd58.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
